  "prompt":"一次函數圖形通過 (0,8) 與 (4,-4)，也通過 (k,14)，則 k 為何？",
  "options":[{"id":"A","text":"-2"},{"id":"B","text":"2"},{"id":"C","text":"6"},{"id":"D","text":"-6"}],
  "knowledgeIds":["kg-math-content-f-8-2"],"difficulty":"medium","answer":{"value":"A","explanation":"斜率=(-4-8)/(4-0)=-3，函數為 y=-3x+8。代入 y=14 得 -3k+8=14，所以 k=-2。"},
